  "decisionHub": {
    "whatItIs": "Sentry is an application error-monitoring, tracing, and session-replay specialist. It sits in the observability-monitoring cluster as a developer-facing peer — not a Datadog infrastructure-monitoring replacement. Developer Free is $0 (1 user, 5k errors). Team is $26/month billed annually with default prepaid event volume; Business $80/month; Enterprise custom. Same cluster as Datadog/Splunk Observability Cloud; different primary shape (errors/replays vs host/infra suites). Does not outrank Datadog 8.6.",
    "bestFor": [
      "Application teams whose primary observability job is errors, traces, and replays",
